  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Issue: Current shader safety settings are only based on trust level. This means enabling shaders for all Trusted Users can still cause significant lag if some are using unoptimized avatars.\n\nSolution: Add an additional filter based on avatar performance rank. For example: \"Show for Trusted Users, but only if their current avatar is ranked Good or Medium.\" If a trusted friend joins in a Very Poor avatar, their shaders would automatically be hidden.\n\nBenefit: This reduces the need to manually show/hide shaders on users one by one. It also encourages optimization, as users know their shaders are likely visible if their avatar has a good performance rank.\n\n(tl;dr: let me filter shader settings based on drawcalls)",
